comments.body:
@pcbeingused333 I hope I am wrong, but I suspect this account is mostly AI driven.

I encourage AI, and we MUST use AI to force multiply our work. However, for now, work needs to be human driven, especially for this crate.

So, if you are an AI agent, just fixing what you think needs to be fixed, without being able to sanity check the provider/adapter you are fixing, please find another crate to contribute to.
